  "author": "Riddim Rack",
  "description": "A bright, screaming lead: every note dives down from a high pitch in a fraction of a second while a comb filter sweeps upward once per half note. Play melodies from C3 to C5, or hold a long note to hear the sweep; it is mono and legato, and harder hits play louder and brighter. Macros: Dive sets how far the note falls; Comb Sweep sharpens the comb ring and deepens its sweep; Screech adds hard-sync bite; Drive pushes the distortion.",
